<rss version="0.92"><channel><item>
            <title>[LU-19526] iov_iter_is_aligned() should be checking actual buffer address</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19526</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;reading iov_iter_is_aligned() I noticed the following code:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div class="code panel" style="border-width: 1px;"&gt;&lt;div class="codeContent panelContent"&gt;
&lt;pre class="code-java"&gt;
&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;static&lt;/span&gt; inline bool iov_iter_is_aligned(&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;const&lt;/span&gt; struct iov_iter *i,
				       unsigned addr_mask, unsigned len_mask)
{
	&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (likely(iter_is_ubuf(i))) {
		&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; (i-&amp;gt;count &amp;amp; len_mask)
			&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;;
		&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;if&lt;/span&gt; ((unsigned &lt;span class="code-object"&gt;long&lt;/span&gt;)(iter_iov(i) + i-&amp;gt;iov_offset) &amp;amp; addr_mask)
			&lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;return&lt;/span&gt; &lt;span class="code-keyword"&gt;false&lt;/span&gt;;
&lt;/pre&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

&lt;p&gt;notice iter_iov&lt;img class="emoticon" src="https://jira.whamcloud.com/images/icons/emoticons/information.png" height="16" width="16" align="absmiddle" alt="" border="0"/&gt; returns struct iovec *, not address of the data.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
                <environment />
        <key id="93203">LU-19526</key>
            <summary>iov_iter_is_aligned() should be checking actual buffer address</summary>
                <type id="1" iconUrl="https://jira.whamcloud.com/secure/viewavatar?size=xsmall&amp;avatarId=11303&amp;avatarType=issuetype">Bug</type>
